# fixture ③/四件套 · 无权限页（ClassifyResult.NO_ENTITLEMENT）
# 出处等级：⚠[SYNTHETIC] —— 合成占位。**runbook 首登后采真实脱敏样本替换**（无 OUP
#   凭证的诚实现实；oup-silverchair.md §7）。结构依详设 §2/§3.1③：有登录无订阅时
#   302→`/article-abstract/` 路由，页含 abstract 摘要 + "Get access"/"Purchase" 面板、
#   **无 article-pdf 全文出口**。此处以 final_url 落 article-abstract 路由 + Get access
#   面板 body 形态落盘（脱敏：无 cookie/token/storage_state/个人信息）。
# 判定依据：final_url 含 `article-abstract` → NO_ENTITLEMENT（且 body 无全文节点，
#   Get access/Purchase 面板亦冗余印证）→ CrawlerError(NO_ENTITLEMENT) → 转 unpaywall OA-fallback。
HTTP-STATUS: 200
X-FINAL-URL: https://academic.oup.com/qje/article-abstract/141/3/2205/8662148
content-type: text/html; charset=UTF-8

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head>
<title>Sample Abstract-Only Article | The Quarterly Journal of Economics | Oxford Academic</title>
<meta name="citation_title" content="A Synthetic Placeholder Article (Abstract Only)"/>
</head>
<body>
<article>
<h1 class="article-title-main">A Synthetic Placeholder Article (Abstract Only)</h1>
<section class="abstract"><h2>Abstract</h2>
<p>This synthetic abstract stands in for a real desensitized sample to be captured at
runbook first-login. No entitlement is present on this account for the full text.</p>
</section>
<div class="access-options-panel">
<h3>Get access</h3>
<p>Access to the full text requires a subscription or purchase.</p>
<a class="js-purchase-link" href="/qje/CheckoutHandler">Purchase</a>
<a href="/Shibboleth.sso/Login">Sign in through your institution</a>
</div>
</article>
</body></html>
